WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:08.790 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  rebel nell is a social enterprise that  exists in detroit michigan we exist to  employ educate and empower women who are  transitioning out of homeless shelter  living and how we do that is we make  jewelry out of graffiti once it crumbles  off the walls  i was living in detroit right next door  to a well-known shelter and i felt this  this desire to do something for my  neighbors  what if we could provide employment as  well as all the tools they need so they  don't end up back in the shelter so we  thought okay let's make a product that's  detroit centric that we could sell  and then one day i just went for a  morning run and i saw  a small little piece of what looked like  paper that had fallen on the ground  and i thought oh that's kind of cool i  wonder what we could do with this  the rest is history  turning trash into something beautiful  i compare it to my life  at one point i felt like that graffiti  that was laying on the ground  i've been through so many traumatic  situations  and  i've grown to something  beautiful  never in a million years i thought i  would be making jury  [Music]  after the graffiti has fallen off of the  wall it has to be processed to reveal  all the different colors  we cut out different shapes and sizes  whatever speaks to us  because of my creative ability  a lot of people are carrying around a  small piece of my city  i think rebel nell's impact starts with  the individual encouraging them to  believe in themselves again we actually  graduate women to jobs that are more in  line with their dreams their visions  their career goals that's really what  inspired me to do it  and these women are my neighbors  you know i believe that you know rising  tide rises all boats  [Music]  you

